# cooling_recipe_regime_aware (C:420-506) with CGMrecipeOn 1, called directly.
# AGN off, dt 1e12: each recipe caps its mass to its whole reservoir (C:288-292,
# :366-370), so each application moves exactly the reservoir. HotGas 0.7 carries
# metals 0.2 (metallicity not exact in double: the fused debit leaves a residual;
# the classic transfer's equality branch would zero it); CGMgas 0.25 carries metals
# 0.4, above the gas (metallicity capped at 1, so 0.15 stays). Mvir 100 above M_shock = 6e11 * 0.73 / 1e10 = 43.8 at z = 0 (ZZ_stored 0), so the streams' cutoff sets f_stream = 0 (C:263-265).
# Diagnostics, Cooling, Heating and the mdot fields hold input bit patterns the
# wrapper may overwrite (-11, -22, -33, -44, -55, -66, -77, -88).
# Reachability: constructed routine-domain probe.
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine cooling_recipe_regime_aware

i32 params.AGNrecipeOn 0  # a probe (AGN off)
i32 params.CGMrecipeOn 1  # R4.par:54
